      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="7" left="36" top="145" width="540" height="14" align-x="36" align-y="159" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Training task    |    Pipe support calculation using revised 3,100 lb load</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="8" left="36" top="162" width="540" height="14" align-x="36" align-y="176" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Status    |    Training submission — not for design release or field use</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="9" left="36" top="179" width="540" height="28" align-x="36" align-y="207" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Calculation basis    |    PTB and reference calculation MCC-1206.12-40-2102, Client Revision 3</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="10" left="36" top="210" width="540" height="19" align-x="36" align-y="229" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Heading 3" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">Training-use notice: This document summarizes the checks visible in the supplied reference calculation. It is not an independently validated design calculation, does not replace the controlled calculation or its appendices, and is not approved for construction or field use. The complete support load path has not been verified from the supplied excerpts.</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="11" left="36" top="232" width="540" height="22" align-x="36" align-y="254" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Subtitle" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1. Purpose and scope</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="12" left="36" top="257" width="540" height="56" align-x="36" align-y="313" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">The purpose of this training exercise is to review the HS-H537 support against the revised vertical design load of 3,100 lb (3.1 kip) specified in the Pre-Task Brief (PTB). The review summarizes the pipe-support assembly, HSS cantilever bending, and HSS-to-W8 weld checks reported in the reference calculation.</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="13" left="36" top="316" width="540" height="70" align-x="36" align-y="386" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">This submission is limited to the information provided in the PTB, the Revision 1A support drawing, and the supplied excerpts from the reference calculation. The PTB identifies this as a training exercise, allocates 24 hours, specifies no PE stamp, and notes that the preparer is not qualified for the task. Required training, qualified review, and procedure/document checks remain applicable.</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="14" left="36" top="389" width="540" height="22" align-x="36" align-y="411" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Subtitle" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2. References</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="15" left="36" top="414" width="540" height="14" align-x="36" align-y="428" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">1. Pre-Task Brief, Quality Form 517-GU-001, Revision 26-06, pages 1–2 and Part C.</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="16" left="36" top="431" width="540" height="14" align-x="36" align-y="445" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">2. Support drawing 2-MCT-HS-H537, Revision 1A, sheet 1 of 1.</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="17" left="36" top="448" width="540" height="28" align-x="36" align-y="476" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">3. Calculation Sheet MCC-1206.12-40-2102, Client Revision 3, Support/Restraint Calculation for Math Model 2HSC, S/R 2-MCT-HS-H537 (EC 422276), supplied excerpts.</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="18" left="36" top="479" width="540" height="42" align-x="36" align-y="521" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">4. Applicable documents identified by the PTB/reference calculation: AD-EG-ALL-1117, AWI-4-23, MCS-1144, MCS-1196, MCS-1206, MCM 1206.00-1059.001, AISC, and the cited component catalogs.</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="19" left="36" top="524" width="540" height="28" align-x="36" align-y="552" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Normal" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">The controlled revisions and applicability of these documents must be confirmed before using the results for engineering release.</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="20" left="36" top="555" width="540" height="22" align-x="36" align-y="577" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
      <ws:text use-page-width="false" push-down="false" lock-width="true">
        <ws:p style="Subtitle" margin-left="inherit" margin-right="inherit" text-indent="inherit" text-align="inherit" list-style-type="inherit" tabs="inherit">3. Design basis and input data</ws:p>
      </ws:text>
    </ws:region>
    <ws:region region-id="21" left="36" top="580" width="540" height="14" align-x="36" align-y="594" show-border="false" show-highlight="false" is-protected="false" z-order="0" background-color="inherit" tag="">
